  "question": {
    "text": "The displacement y of a particle in a medium can be expressed as, $y=10^{-6} \\sin \\left(100 t+20 x+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) m$ where $t$ is in second and $x$ in meter. The speed of the wave is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "WK2Ff",
      "text": "$20 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
