  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "From equation given,\r\n\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\omega=100 \\\\\r\n\r\n\\text { and } \\mathrm{k}=20 \\\\\r\n\r\n\\mathrm{v}=\\frac{\\omega}{\\mathrm{k}}=\\frac{100}{20}=5 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}$",
